This product includes software developed as a research companion to the MESA thesis:
"When the Package Cache Becomes a War Room" (DOI: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22744547).

Research prototype — not production security software.
Property-vector / trifecta concepts build on public prior work (Willison lethal trifecta;
OWASP Least Agency; Meta Rule of Two). MESA-INV-01 directed inbound closure Cl(b) and
this scanner's implementation are original to this project.
